    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Farmer with a woven straw hat, a red plaid shirt with rolled cuffs, a yellow neckerchief, faded denim bib overalls with brass buckles and stitch detail, and green rubber boots. The denim shows believable wear and fade grading, the plaid aligns across the shirt seams, and the rear views confirm the overall bib straps cross correctly at the back with rear pockets present. The straw hat has a modelled woven brim visible in the top view. Rigged: 54-bone humanoid armature (24 body + 30 finger bones), walk and run clips, zero unweighted skinned vertices.",
